      "content": "right, but dont just give me the textbook sociological reasons. like, when they talk about things like the corruption in the central banks or how the education system is basically brainwashing kids, isn't there a grain of truth to that which the media just refuses to touch? it feels like they're pointing out things that are objectively happening.",
