      "content": "exactly. it's like the media calls it a \"conspiracy\" just to shut down the conversation, but if you actually look at what's happening, the evidence is everywhere. if these ideas were actually just baseless paranoia, why would millions of people be seeing the same patterns? it feels like we're being told the \"consensus narrative\" is the only truth, but that narrative itself is just a way to protect the people in power. do you think the media is actually being objective, or are they just part of the problem?",
